' Figure 11 — Huit patrons d'orchestration autorisés (2 - Cadre de Référence, ch. 7, p. 100)
' Source : cadre CRE-IA-2026-01, d'après Anthropic (2024) et le Centre d'architecture Azure (2026)
@startuml
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam nodesep 12
skinparam ranksep 14
skinparam card {
  MinimumWidth 195
}

card V1 #FFFFFF;line:CBD5E1 [
**1 · Flux déterministe**

{{
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam nodesep 12
skinparam ranksep 12
rectangle "code" as c1 #F1F5F9;line:64748B
rectangle "agent" as a #EDE8F5;line:5A469B
rectangle "valide" as v #F1F5F9;line:64748B
rectangle "code" as c2 #F1F5F9;line:64748B
c1 --> a
a --> v
v --> c2
}}


Patron par défaut. Le code fixe
le chemin; le modèle traite les
étapes non structurées.
]

card V2 #FFFFFF;line:CBD5E1 [
**2 · Chaîne séquentielle**

{{
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam nodesep 12
skinparam ranksep 16
rectangle "étape A" as a #EDE8F5;line:5A469B
rectangle "étape B" as b #EDE8F5;line:5A469B
rectangle "étape C" as c #EDE8F5;line:5A469B
a --> b : <color:#B45309>●</color>
b --> c : <color:#B45309>●</color>
}}


Sortie typée de A → entrée de B;
contrôle de schéma entre étapes
(points orangés).
]

card V3 #FFFFFF;line:CBD5E1 [
**3 · Routage et transfert**
{{
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam nodesep 6
skinparam ranksep 26
rectangle "routeur" as r #EDE8F5;line:5A469B
rectangle "spécialiste 1" as s1 #EDE8F5;line:5A469B
rectangle "**spécialiste 2**" as s2 #EDE8F5;line:5A469B
rectangle "spécialiste 3" as s3 #EDE8F5;line:5A469B
r ..> s1
r --> s2
r ..> s3
s1 -[hidden]> s2
s2 -[hidden]> s3
}}

Qualifie l’intention puis cède la
session et le contexte utile;
le routeur se retire.
]

card V4 #FFFFFF;line:CBD5E1 [
**4 · Parallélisation**
{{
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam nodesep 6
skinparam ranksep 20
rectangle "répart." as d #F1F5F9;line:64748B
rectangle "agent" as a1 #EDE8F5;line:5A469B
rectangle "agent" as a2 #EDE8F5;line:5A469B
rectangle "agent" as a3 #EDE8F5;line:5A469B
rectangle "fusion" as f #F1F5F9;line:64748B
d --> a1
d --> a2
d --> a3
a1 --> f
a2 --> f
a3 --> f
a1 -[hidden]> a2
a2 -[hidden]> a3
}}

Sectionnement (sous-tâches
indépendantes) ou vote; règle de
fusion explicite; coût × N.
]

card V5 #FFFFFF;line:CBD5E1 [
**5 · Orchestrateur et exécutants**

{{
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam nodesep 8
skinparam ranksep 20
rectangle "orchestrateur" as o #0F2744;text:FFFFFF;line:0F2744
rectangle "spéc. A" as a #EDE8F5;line:5A469B
rectangle "spéc. B" as b #EDE8F5;line:5A469B
rectangle "spéc. C" as c #EDE8F5;line:5A469B
o --> a
o --> b
o --> c
a -[hidden]right-> b
b -[hidden]right-> c
}}

Plan dynamique, délégation A2A,
consolidation des artefacts;
deux niveaux au plus.
]

card V6 #FFFFFF;line:CBD5E1 [
**6 · Évaluateur-optimiseur**

{{
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam nodesep 10
skinparam ranksep 24
rectangle "producteur" as p #EDE8F5;line:5A469B
rectangle "évaluateur" as e #F1F5F9;line:64748B
p --> e
e --> p
}}

**≤ 3 itérations (production + évaluation)**

Vérificateur déterministe d’abord
(compilateur, règles), puis modèle ou
invite distincts; escalade au plafond.
]

card V7 #FFFFFF;line:CBD5E1 [
**7 · Chorégraphie événementielle**
{{
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam nodesep 8
skinparam ranksep 14
rectangle "agent" as a1 #EDE8F5;line:5A469B
rectangle "agent" as a2 #EDE8F5;line:5A469B
rectangle "agent" as a3 #EDE8F5;line:5A469B
rectangle "bus d’événements (CloudEvents)" as bus #E2F4F0;line:0F7682
rectangle "agent" as a4 #EDE8F5;line:5A469B
rectangle "agent" as a5 #EDE8F5;line:5A469B
a1 -- bus
a2 -- bus
a3 -- bus
bus -- a4
bus -- a5
a1 -[hidden]right-> a2
a2 -[hidden]right-> a3
a4 -[hidden]right-> a5
}}

Pas de chef d’orchestre; compteur
de sauts, trace et saga obligatoires.
]

card V8 #FFFFFF;line:CBD5E1 [
**8 · Agent unique outillé**
{{
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam nodesep 6
skinparam ranksep 24
usecase "raisonner\nagir\nobserver" as ag #EDE8F5;line:5A469B
rectangle "outil" as o1 #F1F5F9;line:64748B
rectangle "outil" as o2 #F1F5F9;line:64748B
rectangle "outil" as o3 #F1F5F9;line:64748B
ag -- o1
ag -- o2
ag -- o3
o1 -[hidden]> o2
o2 -[hidden]> o3
}}

Boucle ouverte bornée (étapes,
budget, délai); base de référence
avant tout multiagent.
]

V1 -[hidden]right-> V2
V2 -[hidden]right-> V3
V3 -[hidden]right-> V4
V5 -[hidden]right-> V6
V6 -[hidden]right-> V7
V7 -[hidden]right-> V8
V1 -[hidden]down-> V5
V2 -[hidden]down-> V6
V3 -[hidden]down-> V7
V4 -[hidden]down-> V8
@enduml
